    {
      "en": ": Um...Molly? Why is Yasu suddenly calling you “Master?”",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because, dearest Xessaxia, I have become her master! And have decided that it is in the best interest of the manga club if she takes after me in every way imaginable!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": With the one minor exception that she may continue to believe in her god as it was the one area she was not willing to budge on.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was an easy decision when every other aspect of me is unworthy and unlovable.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...you don’t know how to play volleyball, Molly. You don’t even go outside.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabatimeyo2",
