      "alt": "futabatimeyo2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct, Xessaxia! Which is why my first course of action is teaching Yasu how to adapt when she is forced to associate with normies!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly! Just serve the damn ball! How long are ya plannin’ on makin’ us wait!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You see, Yasu- sometimes, people will expect things of you that you simply cannot do! And, in moments like that, you must do your best to not let them down!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabatimeyo3",
