      "alt": "futabatimeyo3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So the only course of action is to create your own game! One not bound by the confines of what those unlike us expect!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that...really the only course of action?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is not volleyball, Yasu! This is...demon ball!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think I’m allowed to play this game anymore.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Futaba Fukuyama was one of just several girls currently engaged (or supposed to be engaged) in a casual game of beach volleyball.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And while athletics were certainly not her strong suit, she didn’t mind participating in things like this as the expectations placed on her were rather low.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was a bit demoralizing, sure. But if there’s anything that anyone knows about volleyball in class-type settings, it’s that there will always be weak links who just try to avoid the ball at all costs.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And that was her!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But today, fate had other plans.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...and that’s how you play demon ball!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I understand! May I attempt to expel evil from the ball’s nucleus now?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not before me, Yasu!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Someone just serve the damn ball already! I’m freakin’ out over here!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In the name of the Tuatha Dé Danann, I serve- no. I exorcise thee! Hah!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": THAT’S NOT EVEN THE RIGHT DIRECTION!!!",
