      "alt": "futabatimeyo20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "These parts grew into additional Futaba Fukuyamas. Better ones. Ones that knew how to follow directions and saw themselves not as monsters but as angels.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They surrounded her, skin glistening in the anti-sun, and stared through her eyes and into each others.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Futaba Fukuyama (the original [[?]) felt intimidated by their presence. But, in a strange way, she found it easier looking at them than she did her own reflection.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "These conflicted feelings were subsequently replaced by looming dread as a figure began to sprout in the corner of the room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And while she could not see the figure yet as she fended off her shadows, it saw her. And it cried, for that was all it knew how to do.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It had existed in this space in time for as long as time had existed, and all it knew was pain. Scorn. It was the scapegoat the other ghosts would carve their names into. A scorned half-god.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And it watched in all its untapped fury as Futaba Fukuyama (the original [[?]) conversed with herself.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What...How?...Why?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What does any of this even mean?...When am I going to wake up?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here forever, special girl! No matter what you do!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can change yourself a million times, but you’ll never feel like you!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabatimeyo21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabatimeyo21.webp",
      "alt": "futabatimeyo21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Each time your fingers find your mouth, you give away a piece-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of sanity! Humanity! A chance to be complete!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She knew what they were saying because she wasn’t a fucking moron like you. She’d cleaned blood off her roommate, Occam’s, razor before and wasn’t perplexed by neglected complexities.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She was part of the codex — an abject auspex practicing breakneck safe sex, slipping objects in the convex annexes of each attic in the narthex.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She didn’t care about the effects. She paid no mind to things like that as she was too busy swimming in doubt and cum and more doubt and more cum and you were-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What were you doing?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I watched you last night. And I didn’t quite understand.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Please write your actions down on a piece of construction paper and slip it into my POx box so I can come closer to replicating you for my next art installment.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": X marks the praetor — a letter of love.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The most shameful of angels in gardens above.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know the way out, you can still be complete",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re a fat fucking bitch but I’d lick both your feet.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
