    {
      "en": ": AHHHHAHHAHAHAHAHAH! LOOK AT THE LOOK OF HER LOOK! HER FEELINGS ARE CRAB LEGS INSIDE OF A BOOK!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
